    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d63">

                <pb facs="0064" n="54" sameAs="frus:frus1942China/pg54"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Secretary of State to President
                        Roosevelt </hi><anchor n="10" xml:id="d63-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-05-21">May 21, 1942</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I refer to Ambassador Gauss’ telegram of May 20 in regard to the gravity of the
                    Chinese situation. A paraphrase is enclosed for convenience of reference.</p>
                <pb facs="0065" n="55" xml:id="pg55"/>
                <p>I have sent paraphrases of the telegram to the Secretary of War and to the
                    Secretary of the Navy.</p>
                <p>The last paragraph of the telegram impresses me as containing a very sound and
                    timely recommendation. I venture to hope that it may be given special
                    consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ordell</hi>] H[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >ull</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
